{"id":"n77615-1-7","stage":2,"title":"첫눈 · 初雪","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77615-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 창밖을 보세요! 눈이 와요!","zh":"妈妈，看看窗外！下雪了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"창밖을","meaning":"窗外","explanation":"창밖：窗外；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"창밖","audio":"/audio/2e1834e0644762ee3ea8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71810","senseId":"1","lemma":"창밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보세요!","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈이","meaning":"雪","explanation":"눈：雪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20198","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와요!","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"2e1834e0644762ee","term":"창밖","zh":"窗外","audio":"/audio/2e1834e0644762ee3ea8.mp3","entryId":"71810","definition":"窗户外面。","pronunciation":["창박"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了了解某对象的内容或状态而进行观察。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"雪","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"20198","definition":"空气中的水气结冰后掉到地面后形成的白色棉花状小冰块。","pronunciation":["눈ː"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3bae8bcb3fdd58e26e0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77615-1-7-2","ko":"정말이네. 첫눈이 오는구나.","zh":"真的啊。这是今年的第一场雪呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말이네.","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"첫눈이","meaning":"初雪","explanation":"첫눈：初雪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"첫눈","audio":"/audio/1b4ef4c2829c13187492.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77615","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오는구나.","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"1b4ef4c2829c1318","term":"첫눈","zh":"初雪","audio":"/audio/1b4ef4c2829c13187492.mp3","entryId":"77615","definition":"当年入冬后下的第一场雪。","pronunciation":["천눈"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fa198a648f13c8df76f1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.745,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=77615","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":63,"sequenceScore":1.4703,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":